WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:04.290
A text pings: I literally died laughing.

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.960
Meanwhile, a cross newspaper
headline mourns the death of English.

3
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.150
Did anyone literally die?

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:11.970
No.

5
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:15.460
So is this a decline, or just change?

6
00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.200
In this mission, you'll
meet two attitudes:

7
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.940
one judges language by rules, the
other describes how it's used.

8
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.910
You'll trace how a change
spreads through a community,

9
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.400
and ask whether this one fits the pattern.

10
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:33.040
And you'll meet the vivid metaphors
people reach for when change worries them,

11
00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.480
like a damp spoon and a crumbling castle.

12
00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.420
Your mission: decide
whether it's a decline,

13
00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.680
or just change.
